 "A programmable proof-of-work network secured by miners and usable by anyone who knows Ethereum.": "由矿工保护、懂以太坊的人都能使用的可编程工作量证明网络。",
 "What Quinvium is": "Quinvium 是什么",
 "Quinvium (ticker QU) is an independent blockchain with its own node, wallets and Explorer. Miners produce blocks with the Ethash algorithm on graphics cards, and transactions and contracts run on the EVM, the same machine as in Ethereum.": "Quinvium（代码 QU）是一条独立的区块链，拥有自己的节点、钱包和浏览器。矿工用显卡运行 Ethash 算法出块，交易和合约在 EVM 上运行，与以太坊使用同一台虚拟机。",
 "The name comes from the Latin <em>quinta essentia</em>, the fifth essence. The mark is the letter Q drawn as a hexagon, the shape of a block in a chain. The currency is called Quinvium, its ticker is QU, and it has its own symbol.": "名称来自拉丁语 <em>quinta essentia</em>，即“第五元素”。标志是画成六边形的字母 Q，即链中区块的形状。货币名为 Quinvium，代码为 QU，并有自己的符号。",
 "Why proof-of-work and the EVM": "为什么选择工作量证明和 EVM",
 "Proof-of-Work": "工作量证明",
 "The order of transactions is decided by work done, not by the size of a stake. Anyone with a graphics card can take part.": "交易顺序由完成的工作决定，而非质押规模。任何拥有显卡的人都能参与。",
 "EVM": "EVM",
 "Contracts, tools and wallets from Ethereum work without changes. Developers have nothing new to learn.": "以太坊的合约、工具和钱包无需修改即可使用。开发者无需学习新东西。",
