 "<span>5 (to ~19.0 yrs)</span><span>32–40 M</span><span>0.25 QU</span><span>2 M</span><span>62 M</span>": "<span>5（约至 19.0 年）</span><span>3200 万–4000 万</span><span>0.25 QU</span><span>200 万</span><span>6200 万</span>",
 "<span>6 (to ~22.8 yrs)</span><span>40–48 M</span><span>0.125 QU</span><span>1 M</span><span>63 M</span>": "<span>6（约至 22.8 年）</span><span>4000 万–4800 万</span><span>0.125 QU</span><span>100 万</span><span>6300 万</span>",
 "The real cap is slightly below 64 million because of rounding. Era lengths assume the 15 s target block time.": "由于取整，实际上限略低于 6400 万。各阶段时长按 15 秒目标出块时间计算。",
 "Fees": "手续费",
 "All to the miner": "全部归矿工",
 "The base fee is not burned. The block miner receives the full fee of every transaction.": "基础费不会被销毁。出块矿工获得每笔交易的全部手续费。",
 "EIP-1559": "EIP-1559",
 "The base fee follows block usage, with a minimum of 1 gwei.": "基础费随区块使用率变化，最低 1 gwei。",
 "Gas limit": "Gas 上限",
 "10 million gas per block; miners can vote it up to at most 15 million.": "每块 1000 万 gas；矿工可投票将其提高到最多 1500 万。",
 "What the network does not have": "网络没有的东西",
 "A premine, presale, developer allocation or treasury.": "预挖、预售、开发者分配或金库。",
 "Fee burning or other supply reduction.": "手续费销毁或其他供应削减。",
 "Staking. Blocks come only from mining.": "质押。区块只来自挖矿。",
 "Mining Quinvium · Quinvium": "挖 Quinvium · Quinvium",
 "How to mine QU on a graphics card: the Quinvium app, your own node and miner, pools that pay out through a contract.": "如何用显卡挖 QU：Quinvium 应用、自己的节点与矿机程序、通过合约付款的矿池。",
 "Mining Quinvium": "挖 Quinvium",
 "<a class=\"ng-btn here\" href=\"/mining/\" aria-current=\"page\">Mine</a>": "<a class=\"ng-btn here\" href=\"/mining/\" aria-current=\"page\">挖矿</a>",
 "A graphics card, the app and a payout address. That is all.": "一张显卡、应用和一个收款地址，仅此而已。",
 "What you need": "你需要什么",
 "A graphics card": "一张显卡",
 "AMD or NVIDIA with at least 2 GB of memory. The algorithm data (DAG) grows over time, so more memory lasts longer. Ethash ASICs are allowed too.": "至少 2 GB 显存的 AMD 或 NVIDIA 显卡。算法数据（DAG）会随时间增长，显存越大能用越久。也允许使用 Ethash ASIC。",
 "A payout address": "一个收款地址",
 "Any 0x… address from your wallet. Rewards are paid straight to it.": "你钱包里的任意 0x… 地址。奖励直接支付到该地址。",
 "A connection": "网络连接",
 "The node joins the network on its own through seed.quinvium.com.": "节点会通过 seed.quinvium.com 自动加入网络。",
 "Mining in the Quinvium app": "在 Quinvium 应用中挖矿",
 "Install the app for macOS or Windows. <a href=\"/download/\">Download</a>": "安装适用于 macOS 或 Windows 的应用。<a href=\"/download/\">下载</a>",
 "Choose the Mainnet network. The app starts its own node and downloads the chain.": "选择主网。应用会启动自己的节点并下载区块链。",
 "In Mining, enter your payout address and switch mining on.": "在“挖矿”中输入收款地址并开启挖矿。",
 "Your own node and miner": "自己的节点和矿机程序",
 "The command-line node and the <code>quintium-miner</code> GPU miner:": "命令行节点和 GPU 矿机程序 <code>quintium-miner</code>：",
 "The node also offers Stratum (port 3333), so other Ethash miners work too. For miners on your local network start the node with <code>--stratum-host 0.0.0.0</code>.": "节点还提供 Stratum（端口 3333），因此其他 Ethash 矿机程序也能使用。若要让局域网中的矿机连接，请用 <code>--stratum-host 0.0.0.0</code> 启动节点。",
 "Solo or pool": "单独挖还是矿池",
 "Solo": "单独挖矿",
 "You get the whole block and its fees, but with one card there can be a long wait between blocks.": "你会获得整个区块及其手续费，但只有一张显卡时，两次出块之间可能要等很久。",
 "Contract pool": "合约矿池",
 "The pool factory is built into the network. A pool counts miner shares and the contract pays rewards by them. The official Quinvium Pool runs at pool.quinvium.com with a 1 % fee.": "矿池工厂内置于网络。矿池统计矿工的份额，合约据此发放奖励。官方 Quinvium Pool 运行在 pool.quinvium.com，手续费 1%。",
 "Run a pool": "运营矿池",
 "A pool on Quinvium is a smart contract from the network factory. Rewards go straight into the contract, which splits them by proven work (PPLNS); the operator can take only its fixed fee, at most 5 %.": "Quinvium 上的矿池是由网络工厂创建的智能合约。奖励直接进入合约，按已证明的工作分配（PPLNS）；运营者只能收取固定手续费，最多 5%。",
 "Create the contract": "创建合约",
 "In the Explorer, Pools → Create a pool, or:": "在浏览器中选择“矿池 → 创建矿池”，或：",
 "Run the pool server": "运行矿池服务器",
 "A node with --pool. The node's own account pays gas for shares; send it a little QU.": "使用 --pool 启动的节点。节点自己的账户支付份额的 gas，请给它转一点 QU。",
 "Bring miners": "吸引矿工",
 "Miners connect with the miner or over Stratum and withdraw earnings in the app or the Explorer.": "矿工用矿机程序或通过 Stratum 连接，并在应用或浏览器中提取收益。",
 "Full pool guide": "矿池完整指南",
 "Pools in the Explorer": "浏览器中的矿池",
 "Difficulty": "难度",
 "Difficulty adjusts after every block based on the last 60 blocks (LWMA). When hashrate joins, blocks speed up for a while and difficulty catches up within minutes. When hashrate leaves, it settles the same way. The minimum difficulty is 2<sup>24</sup>.": "难度在每个区块后根据最近 60 个区块调整（LWMA）。算力加入时，出块会暂时加快，难度在几分钟内跟上；算力离开时也会同样趋稳。最低难度为 2<sup>24</sup>。",
 "Mining questions": "挖矿问题",
 "How much will I mine?": "我能挖多少？",
 "Your share of the network hashrate times 4 QU per block. About 5,760 blocks are made a day, roughly 23,040 QU for the whole network. The current hashrate is on the home page and in the Explorer.": "你在全网算力中的占比乘以每块 4 QU。每天约产生 5,760 个区块，全网约 23,040 QU。当前算力可在首页和浏览器中查看。",
 "How fast does the reward arrive?": "奖励多快到账？",
 "Immediately with the block. The reward is part of the block you mine.": "随区块立即到账。奖励是你挖出的区块的一部分。",
 "Can I mine on a cloud server?": "可以在云服务器上挖矿吗？",
 "That depends on the provider's terms. Many of them forbid mining.": "取决于服务商的条款。很多服务商禁止挖矿。",
 "Wallets for Quinvium · Quinvium": "Quinvium 钱包 · Quinvium",
 "The Quinvium app, Wpayin for iOS and Android, the Chrome wallet and MetaMask.": "Quinvium 应用、iOS 和 Android 的 Wpayin、Chrome 钱包和 MetaMask。",
 "Wallets for Quinvium": "Quinvium 钱包",
 "Only you hold the keys. No Quinvium wallet sends them anywhere.": "只有你持有密钥。任何 Quinvium 钱包都不会把它们发送到别处。",
 "For macOS and Windows. Wallet, full node, mining, Explorer and Swap in one.": "适用于 macOS 和 Windows。钱包、全节点、挖矿、浏览器和兑换合而为一。",
 "A mobile wallet for iOS and Android with Quinvium, Swap and P2P trading.": "支持 Quinvium、兑换和 P2P 交易的 iOS 与 Android 移动钱包。",
 "Chrome wallet": "Chrome 钱包",
 "A browser extension for Quinvium apps, with its own encrypted storage.": "用于 Quinvium 应用的浏览器扩展，拥有自己的加密存储。",
 "MetaMask": "MetaMask",
 "Works as with any EVM network. Add the network with the button below.": "和任何 EVM 网络一样使用。用下面的按钮添加网络。",
 "Get the app and the Chrome wallet on the <a href=\"/download/\">Download page</a>.": "在<a href=\"/download/\">下载页面</a>获取应用和 Chrome 钱包。",
 "Add Quinvium to MetaMask": "将 Quinvium 添加到 MetaMask",
 "Add mainnet to MetaMask": "将主网添加到 MetaMask",
 "Add testnet": "添加测试网",
 "<span></span><span>Mainnet</span><span>Testnet</span>": "<span></span><span>主网</span><span>测试网</span>",
 "<span>Chain ID</span><code>52401</code><code>52402</code>": "<span>链 ID</span><code>52401</code><code>52402</code>",
 "<span>Currency</span><code>QU</code><code>tQU</code>": "<span>货币</span><code>QU</code><code>tQU</code>",
 "<span>RPC (HTTPS)</span><code>https://rpc.quinvium.com</code><code>https://rpc1.quinvium.com</code>": "<span>RPC（HTTPS）</span><code>https://rpc.quinvium.com</code><code>https://rpc1.quinvium.com</code>",
 "<span>WebSocket</span><code>wss://rpc.quinvium.com</code><code>wss://rpc1.quinvium.com</code>": "<span>WebSocket</span><code>wss://rpc.quinvium.com</code><code>wss://rpc1.quinvium.com</code>",
 "<span>Explorer</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com\">explorer.quinvium.com</a><a href=\"https://testnet.quinvium.com\">testnet.quinvium.com</a>": "<span>浏览器</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com\">explorer.quinvium.com</a><a href=\"https://testnet.quinvium.com\">testnet.quinvium.com</a>",
 "<span>P2P seed</span><code>seed.quinvium.com:30524</code><code>seed.quinvium.com:30525</code>": "<span>P2P 种子节点</span><code>seed.quinvium.com:30524</code><code>seed.quinvium.com:30525</code>",
 "Wallet safety": "钱包安全",
 "Write the recovery phrase on paper and keep it offline. Whoever knows it owns your funds.": "把助记词写在纸上并离线保存。知道它的人就拥有你的资金。",
 "Never share the phrase. Anyone who asks for it is a scammer.": "绝不要分享助记词。索要它的人都是骗子。",
 "Before signing, check the network (chain ID 52401), the address and the amount.": "签名前请检查网络（链 ID 52401）、地址和金额。",
 "Verify tokens by contract address, not by name. Anyone can pick any name.": "请通过合约地址而非名称来核实代币。任何人都能取任何名字。",
 "The Quinvium ecosystem · Quinvium": "Quinvium 生态 · Quinvium",
 "Built-in network apps, Swap, P2P, pools and tools.": "内置网络应用、兑换、P2P、矿池和工具。",
 "The Quinvium ecosystem": "Quinvium 生态",
 "What runs in the network from block one and what is still testnet-only.": "哪些从第一个区块起就在网络中运行，哪些仍仅在测试网。",
 "Built-in contracts (mainnet and testnet)": "内置合约（主网和测试网）",
 "<strong>Notary</strong><span>Proof that a document existed at a block time.</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000001\"><code>0xae00…0001</code></a>": "<strong>公证</strong><span>证明文件在某个区块时间已经存在。</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000001\"><code>0xae00…0001</code></a>",
 "<strong>.qu names</strong><span>A readable name instead of an address.</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000002\"><code>0xae00…0002</code></a>": "<strong>.qu 名称</strong><span>用易读的名称代替地址。</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000002\"><code>0xae00…0002</code></a>",
 "<strong>Credentials</strong><span>Issue and revoke credentials.</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000003\"><code>0xae00…0003</code></a>": "<strong>证书</strong><span>颁发和撤销证书。</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000003\"><code>0xae00…0003</code></a>",
 "<strong>Supply chain</strong><span>Step-by-step history of a shipment.</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000004\"><code>0xae00…0004</code></a>": "<strong>供应链</strong><span>货物的逐步流转记录。</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000004\"><code>0xae00…0004</code></a>",
 "<strong>Escrow</strong><span>Payment released when a condition is met.</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000005\"><code>0xae00…0005</code></a>": "<strong>托管</strong><span>满足条件时释放付款。</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000005\"><code>0xae00…0005</code></a>",
 "<strong>Polls</strong><span>On-chain polls and votes.</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000006\"><code>0xae00…0006</code></a>": "<strong>投票</strong><span>链上调查与投票。</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000006\"><code>0xae00…0006</code></a>",
 "<strong>Token factory</strong><span>Your own ERC-20 token without writing code.</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000007\"><code>0xae00…0007</code></a>": "<strong>代币工厂</strong><span>无需写代码即可创建自己的 ERC-20 代币。</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000007\"><code>0xae00…0007</code></a>",
 "<strong>NFT collections</strong><span>Your own ERC-721 collection.</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000008\"><code>0xae00…0008</code></a>": "<strong>NFT 合集</strong><span>你自己的 ERC-721 合集。</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000008\"><code>0xae00…0008</code></a>",
 "<strong>Multisig</strong><span>A wallet that needs several signatures.</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000009\"><code>0xae00…0009</code></a>": "<strong>多签</strong><span>需要多个签名的钱包。</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae00000000000000000000000000000000000009\"><code>0xae00…0009</code></a>",
 "<strong>Wrapped QU (WQU)</strong><span>QU as an ERC-20 token.</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae0000000000000000000000000000000000000a\"><code>0xae00…000a</code></a>": "<strong>Wrapped QU（WQU）</strong><span>作为 ERC-20 代币的 QU。</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae0000000000000000000000000000000000000a\"><code>0xae00…000a</code></a>",
 "<strong>Multicall</strong><span>Several reads in one call.</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae0000000000000000000000000000000000000b\"><code>0xae00…000b</code></a>": "<strong>Multicall</strong><span>一次调用完成多次读取。</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae0000000000000000000000000000000000000b\"><code>0xae00…000b</code></a>",
 "<strong>Pool factory</strong><span>Mining pools that pay out through a contract.</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae0000000000000000000000000000000000000c\"><code>0xae00…000c</code></a>": "<strong>矿池工厂</strong><span>通过合约付款的矿池。</span><a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/address/0xae0000000000000000000000000000000000000c\"><code>0xae00…000c</code></a>",
 "Testnet only for now": "目前仅限测试网",
 "Swap": "兑换",
 "An exchange with liquidity pools (factory and router). Not deployed on mainnet yet.": "带流动性池（工厂和路由）的兑换所，尚未部署到主网。",
 "Direct trades between two parties through AirSwap SwapERC20 v4.3, with no fees. Not on mainnet yet.": "通过 AirSwap SwapERC20 v4.3 进行的双方直接交易，无手续费。尚未上主网。",
 "Verified token list": "已验证代币列表",
 "Not on mainnet yet. It waits for multisig governance.": "尚未上主网，等待多签治理。",
 "A bridge to other networks is written but not deployed anywhere. On mainnet it will run only with independent validators.": "连接其他网络的跨链桥已写好，但尚未在任何地方部署。在主网上它只会在有独立验证者时运行。",
 "Tools": "工具",
 "Blocks, transactions, addresses, tokens, network apps and documentation. <a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com\">explorer.quinvium.com</a>": "区块、交易、地址、代币、网络应用和文档。<a href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com\">explorer.quinvium.com</a>",
 "Command line": "命令行",
 "The <code>quinvium</code> command handles the wallet, transfers and every network app, in Czech and English.": "<code>quinvium</code> 命令可处理钱包、转账和所有网络应用，支持捷克语和英语。",
 "Full node": "全节点",
 "A JavaScript node with the EVM, sync, JSON-RPC, Stratum and a pool server.": "带 EVM、同步、JSON-RPC、Stratum 和矿池服务器的 JavaScript 节点。",
 "Quinvium for developers · Quinvium": "面向开发者的 Quinvium · Quinvium",
 "Network parameters, JSON-RPC, running a node and built-in contract addresses.": "网络参数、JSON-RPC、节点运行和内置合约地址。",
 "Quinvium for developers": "面向开发者的 Quinvium",
 "If you know Ethereum, you know Quinvium.": "懂以太坊，就懂 Quinvium。",
 "Network parameters": "网络参数",
 "Quick start": "快速开始",
 "Hardhat: add the network to <code>hardhat.config.js</code>:": "Hardhat：在 <code>hardhat.config.js</code> 中添加网络：",
 "JSON-RPC": "JSON-RPC",
 "Standard <code>eth_*</code>, <code>net_*</code> and <code>web3_*</code> methods, including WebSocket subscriptions.": "标准 <code>eth_*</code>、<code>net_*</code> 和 <code>web3_*</code> 方法，包括 WebSocket 订阅。",
 "Extra <code>quinvium_*</code> methods for the Explorer: stats, addresses, tokens, miners, pools, search.": "供浏览器使用的额外 <code>quinvium_*</code> 方法：统计、地址、代币、矿工、矿池、搜索。",
 "Public nodes have mining methods (<code>eth_getWork</code>, <code>eth_submitWork</code>) switched off and a request limit.": "公共节点关闭了挖矿方法（<code>eth_getWork</code>、<code>eth_submitWork</code>），并有请求限制。",
 "<a class=\"more\" href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/api\">Full RPC, REST API and contract documentation →</a>": "<a class=\"more\" href=\"https://explorer.quinvium.com/api\">完整的 RPC、REST API 与合约文档 →</a>",
 "Run a node": "运行节点",
 "<span>Mainnet ports</span><span>P2P 30524 · RPC 8545 · Stratum 3333</span>": "<span>主网端口</span><span>P2P 30524 · RPC 8545 · Stratum 3333</span>",
 "<span>Testnet ports</span><span>P2P 30525 · RPC 8546 · Stratum 3334</span>": "<span>测试网端口</span><span>P2P 30525 · RPC 8546 · Stratum 3334</span>",
 "<span>Public node</span><span><code>--no-mining-rpc</code>, RPC only behind your own HTTPS proxy with <code>--trust-proxy</code></span>": "<span>公共节点</span><span><code>--no-mining-rpc</code>，RPC 只放在你自己的 HTTPS 代理之后，并使用 <code>--trust-proxy</code></span>",
 "<span>Requirements</span><span>Node.js 24</span>": "<span>要求</span><span>Node.js 24</span>",
