 "The testnet (chain ID 52402, tQU coins with no value) has the same rules plus Swap and P2P. There is no faucet yet: mine tQU or ask for some. <a href=\"https://testnet.quinvium.com\">testnet.quinvium.com</a>": "测试网（链 ID 52402，tQU 币无价值）规则相同，另有兑换和 P2P。目前还没有水龙头：请挖 tQU 或向他人索取。<a href=\"https://testnet.quinvium.com\">testnet.quinvium.com</a>",
 "Quinvium roadmap · Quinvium": "Quinvium 路线图 · Quinvium",
 "What is done and what is planned.": "已完成和已计划的内容。",
 "Quinvium roadmap": "Quinvium 路线图",
 "Intentions, not promises. Dates only where something is decided.": "这是意向而非承诺。只有已确定的事项才有日期。",
 "<strong>Done</strong><span>Node, EVM, GPU mining, contract pools, Explorer in eight languages, macOS and Windows app, Chrome wallet, Wpayin, command line, public testnet.</span>": "<strong>已完成</strong><span>节点、EVM、GPU 挖矿、合约矿池、八种语言的浏览器、macOS 和 Windows 应用、Chrome 钱包、Wpayin、命令行、公共测试网。</span>",
 "<strong>14 Nov 2026</strong><span>Mainnet launch, public node rpc.quinvium.com and the Explorer.</span>": "<strong>2026 年 11 月 14 日</strong><span>主网启动，公共节点 rpc.quinvium.com 和浏览器上线。</span>",
 "<strong>Next</strong><span>An independent security audit. A second public node with another provider. An update-signing key off the development machine and remote updates switched back on. Signed Windows builds and the wallet in the Chrome Web Store.</span>": "<strong>下一步</strong><span>独立安全审计。在另一家服务商部署第二个公共节点。将更新签名密钥移出开发机器并重新开启远程更新。签名的 Windows 版本以及 Chrome 网上应用店中的钱包。</span>",
 "<strong>Later</strong><span>Swap and a verified token list on mainnet under multisig governance. A bridge with independent validators. Compact blocks and state pruning for heavy traffic.</span>": "<strong>以后</strong><span>在多签治理下于主网推出兑换和已验证代币列表。由独立验证者运行的跨链桥。面向高流量的紧凑区块和状态修剪。</span>",
 "Security · Quinvium": "安全 · Quinvium",
 "Quinvium security status, code reviews and vulnerability reports.": "Quinvium 的安全状况、代码审查和漏洞报告。",
 "Honestly: the code is thoroughly tested, but no independent audit has been done yet.": "坦白说：代码经过了充分测试，但尚未进行独立审计。",
 "Status": "现状",
 "Automated tests of the node, contracts, wallets and Explorer, including the official Ethereum EVM test suite.": "对节点、合约、钱包和浏览器的自动化测试，包括以太坊官方 EVM 测试套件。",
 "Internal code reviews on 7–8, 10 and 13 November 2026, with the findings fixed.": "2026 年 11 月 7–8 日、10 日和 13 日进行了内部代码审查，发现的问题已修复。",
 "No independent security audit has been done yet.": "尚未进行独立安全审计。",
 "Remote app updates are off on mainnet until the signing key is moved off the development machine.": "在签名密钥移出开发机器之前，主网上的应用远程更新保持关闭。",
 "The network is carried by one public server and the miners' nodes so far.": "目前网络由一台公共服务器和矿工的节点支撑。",
 "Reporting a vulnerability": "报告漏洞",
 "Report vulnerabilities privately on GitHub: <a href=\"https://github.com/Lakylife/quinvium/security/advisories/new\">Report a vulnerability</a>. Please do not disclose them publicly before a fix.": "请在 GitHub 上私下报告漏洞：<a href=\"https://github.com/Lakylife/quinvium/security/advisories/new\">Report a vulnerability</a>。修复前请勿公开。",
 "Risks": "风险",
 "Quinvium is experimental software. A small proof-of-work network can be briefly rewritten with rented hashrate, so wait for more confirmations on larger payments. Do not store more than you can afford to lose.": "Quinvium 是实验性软件。小型工作量证明网络可能被租来的算力短暂改写，因此大额付款请等待更多确认。不要存放超过你能承受损失的金额。",
 "Download Quinvium · Quinvium": "下载 Quinvium · Quinvium",
