 "Android": "Android",
 "Wpayin for Android with Quinvium support. APK builds are published on GitHub. <a href=\"https://github.com/Lakylife/wpayin-erc20-android-app/releases\">github.com/Lakylife/wpayin-erc20-android-app</a>": "支持 Quinvium 的 Android 版 Wpayin。APK 版本发布在 GitHub 上。<a href=\"https://github.com/Lakylife/wpayin-erc20-android-app/releases\">github.com/Lakylife/wpayin-erc20-android-app</a>",
