 "First launch": "首次启动",
 "macOS": "macOS",
 "Unzip and move Quinvium to Applications. On first launch macOS says it cannot verify the developer: open <b>System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security</b> and click <b>Open Anyway</b>, or right-click the app and choose <b>Open</b>. The app is built for Intel; Apple Silicon Macs run it through Rosetta.": "解压并将 Quinvium 移到“应用程序”。首次启动时 macOS 会提示无法验证开发者：打开<b>系统设置 → 隐私与安全性</b>并点击<b>仍要打开</b>，或右键点击应用选择<b>打开</b>。应用为 Intel 构建，Apple 芯片的 Mac 通过 Rosetta 运行。",
 "Windows": "Windows",
 "Run the installer. If SmartScreen shows \"Windows protected your PC\", click <b>More info → Run anyway</b>. The portable zip runs without installing.": "运行安装程序。如果 SmartScreen 显示“Windows 已保护你的电脑”，点击<b>更多信息 → 仍要运行</b>。便携 zip 版无需安装即可运行。",
 "Unzip the file to a folder you will keep.": "将文件解压到一个会长期保留的文件夹。",
 "Open <code>chrome://extensions</code> and switch on <b>Developer mode</b>.": "打开 <code>chrome://extensions</code> 并开启<b>开发者模式</b>。",
 "Click <b>Load unpacked</b> and choose the unzipped folder.": "点击<b>加载已解压的扩展程序</b>并选择解压后的文件夹。",
 "Verify the checksum": "核对校验和",
 "Download only from quinvium.com. Builds from other sources may be fake. Remote updates are switched off on mainnet, so new versions are installed by hand from this page.": "请只从 quinvium.com 下载。其他来源的版本可能是伪造的。主网已关闭远程更新，因此新版本需从本页手动安装。",
 "Frequently asked questions · Quinvium": "常见问题 · Quinvium",
 "Answers to common questions about Quinvium.": "关于 Quinvium 的常见问题解答。",
 "Frequently asked questions": "常见问题",
 "Short and plain.": "简短明了。",
 "What is Quinvium?": "Quinvium 是什么？",
 "An independent blockchain with proof-of-work (Ethash) and the EVM. The coin is QU.": "一条采用工作量证明（Ethash）和 EVM 的独立区块链。币为 QU。",
 "Is it a fork of Ethereum?": "它是以太坊的分叉吗？",
 "No. The node is its own JavaScript code using the EVM from EthereumJS. It does not carry Ethereum's history.": "不是。节点是自己的 JavaScript 代码，使用 EthereumJS 的 EVM，不继承以太坊的历史。",
 "How many QU will ever exist?": "总共会有多少 QU？",
 "At most 64 million. The 4 QU block reward halves every 8 million blocks.": "最多 6400 万。每块 4 QU 的奖励每 800 万个区块减半。",
 "No. The genesis has no balances.": "没有。创世区块没有任何余额。",
 "Is QU an investment?": "QU 是投资吗？",
 "No. Quinvium makes no promises about price or returns. It is experimental software.": "不是。Quinvium 对价格或收益不做任何承诺。它是实验性软件。",
 "Which graphics card do I need?": "需要什么显卡？",
 "AMD or NVIDIA with at least 2 GB of memory. More memory lasts longer because the algorithm data grows.": "至少 2 GB 显存的 AMD 或 NVIDIA。由于算法数据会增长，显存越大能用越久。",
 "Are ASICs allowed?": "允许使用 ASIC 吗？",
 "Yes. Ethash is unchanged.": "允许。Ethash 未作修改。",
 "Yes, as with any EVM network. Add the network on the Wallets page.": "可以，和任何 EVM 网络一样。在“钱包”页面添加网络。",
 "How fast are blocks?": "出块有多快？",
 "The target is 15 seconds. Difficulty adjusts after every block.": "目标为 15 秒。难度在每个区块后调整。",
 "When is a payment final?": "付款何时最终确定？",
 "Each new block makes it firmer. Nodes refuse a rewrite deeper than 256 blocks (about an hour).": "每个新区块都会让它更稳固。节点会拒绝深于 256 个区块（约一小时）的改写。",
 "Internal reviews yes, an independent audit not yet.": "内部审查有，独立审计尚未进行。",
 "What is the testnet?": "什么是测试网？",
 "A test network with tQU coins that have no value, for development and testing.": "使用无价值 tQU 币的测试网络，用于开发和测试。",
 "Where is the source code?": "源代码在哪里？",
 "On GitHub under the MIT license: <a href=\"https://github.com/Lakylife/quinvium\">github.com/Lakylife/quinvium</a>. Anyone can read, run, verify and build on it.": "以 MIT 许可证托管在 GitHub：<a href=\"https://github.com/Lakylife/quinvium\">github.com/Lakylife/quinvium</a>。任何人都可以阅读、运行、验证并在其上构建。",
 "Disclaimer · Quinvium": "免责声明 · Quinvium",
 "Quinvium is experimental software without warranty.": "Quinvium 是不提供担保的实验性软件。",
 "Disclaimer": "免责声明",
 "Please read before use.": "使用前请阅读。",
 "Quinvium is experimental software provided as is, without any warranty.": "Quinvium 是按原样提供的实验性软件，不附带任何担保。",
 "Nothing on this site is investment, financial, tax or legal advice.": "本网站的任何内容都不构成投资、财务、税务或法律建议。",
 "Users are responsible for any loss of funds, keys or data. Blockchain transactions cannot be reversed.": "用户须对资金、密钥或数据的任何损失自行负责。区块链交易无法撤销。",
 "Complying with the rules in your country, including taxes and crypto-asset regulation, is up to you.": "遵守你所在国家的规定（包括税务和加密资产监管）由你自行负责。",
 "This site uses no cookies or tracking. The light or dark theme you choose is stored only in your browser.": "本网站不使用 Cookie，也不跟踪。你选择的浅色或深色主题只保存在你的浏览器中。",
 "Contact · Quinvium": "联系 · Quinvium",
 "The community around the Quinvium network.": "围绕 Quinvium 网络的社区。",
 "Quinvium is a decentralised network with no company and no owner. News and discussion are on X and Telegram.": "Quinvium 是没有公司、没有所有者的去中心化网络。新闻和讨论在 X 和 Telegram 上。",
 "E-mail": "电子邮件",
