 "<a href=\"https://x.com/Quinvium\" rel=\"me\">@Quinvium</a>, news and announcements": "<a href=\"https://x.com/Quinvium\" rel=\"me\">@Quinvium</a>，新闻与公告",
 "<a href=\"https://t.me/Quinvium\" rel=\"me\">t.me/Quinvium</a>, community chat": "<a href=\"https://t.me/Quinvium\" rel=\"me\">t.me/Quinvium</a>，社区聊天",
 "<a href=\"https://github.com/Lakylife/quinvium\">github.com/Lakylife/quinvium</a>, issues and pull requests welcome.": "<a href=\"https://github.com/Lakylife/quinvium\">github.com/Lakylife/quinvium</a>，欢迎提交 issue 和 pull request。",
 "Anyone who asks for your recovery phrase or for coins “for verification” is a scammer.": "任何向你索要助记词或“用于验证”的币的人都是骗子。",
 "Quinvium whitepaper · Quinvium": "Quinvium 白皮书 · Quinvium",
 "A programmable proof-of-work network for GPU miners: consensus, execution, monetary policy, built-in contracts, networking, security and roadmap.": "面向 GPU 矿工的可编程工作量证明网络：共识、执行、货币政策、内置合约、网络、安全和路线图。",
 "Quinvium whitepaper": "Quinvium 白皮书",
 "A programmable proof-of-work network for GPU miners. Version 1.0, 14 November 2026.": "面向 GPU 矿工的可编程工作量证明网络。版本 1.0，2026 年 11 月 14 日。白皮书正文为英文。",
 "Live from the network, refreshed every 15 s.": "实时来自网络，每 15 秒刷新。",
 "No node is answering right now.": "目前没有节点响应。",
 "<strong>Keep this page alive.</strong> These numbers come from nodes that people run. Run the Quinvium app and turn on Share node publicly: your node then serves this page, the Explorer and wallets when the main servers are down. <a href=\"/download/\">Get the app</a>": "<strong>帮助本页面保持在线。</strong> 这些数字来自人们运行的节点。运行 Quinvium 应用并开启“公开共享节点”：当主服务器宕机时，您的节点将为本页面、Explorer 和钱包提供数据。<a href=\"/download/\">获取应用</a>",
 "<a href=\"https://bitcointalk.org/index.php?topic=5600215.0\">Announcement [ANN]</a>, thread for miners and pools": "<a href=\"https://bitcointalk.org/index.php?topic=5600215.0\">公告 [ANN]</a>，面向矿工和矿池的讨论帖",
 "Bitcointalk": "Bitcointalk"
}
